**Current phase, 2026-11-19:** prioritize measurement improvements now, then stop for the owner to reboot into Park with the new binary. On return, continue with the measurement-first order below after checking the running revision and available tooling. The November 15–17 source-only/review-only execution deferrals are historical for that resumed visit. This turn changes documents only; do not reboot, launch Park, build or start measurements now.

[Overhaul.md](Overhaul.md#owner-review--what-changed-and-what-is-really-left-2026-11-17) contains the consolidated review: removed computation, preserved behavior, uncertainties, historical evidence and remaining work. Its receipts and the attribution registry retain the detail.

**Counted inventory:** 488 recorded implementation mechanisms; 471 detailed unrun verification/acceptance obligations; 85 open P-task Records grouped below. These are different, overlapping units and must not be added or turned into a completion percentage. The 488 entries are not independently proven speedups. The detailed checklist contains 456 VERIFY-labelled entries plus 15 edit/reveal/input/render/settling acceptance entries; it does not represent 471 missing optimizations or guaranteed runnable selectors.

